{
  "adds": ["frule"],
  "tray": "machine",
  "title": { "zh": "停不下来的定义" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "有人这样「定义」一个函数：f x = S (f x)。定义板不会收下它：要算 f 0，先得算 f 0，永远算不完。假如收下了，会怎样？"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "Isabelle 的 fun、Lean 的 def 收下递归定义之前，都要先证明它终止。"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "in-loop",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "proved",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "backtrack": true,
      "words": ["everyday", "terms"],
      "types": ["nat"],
      "tests": [{ "goal": "⊥", "hyps": ["∀x. f(x) = s(f(x))"] }],
      "brief": { "zh": "设计一个证明助手，证完每一个目标。" },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "「数理规则书」里有一条证出的等式和这句定义正好相冲。"
        },
        { "zh": "两句「对所有」各取出一句具体的。" }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "c0r0 = mp[use=[cut]]()",
        "c1r0 = math[use=[succNeq]]()",
        "c2r0 = allE[use=[spec]]()",
        "c3r0 = allE[use=[spec]]()",
        "c4r0 = mp[use=[mp]]()",
        "c0 = rule(in, c0r0)",
        "c1 = rule(c0, c1r0)",
        "c2 = frule(c1, c2r0)",
        "c3 = frule(c2, c3r0)",
        "c4 = erule(c3, c4r0)",
        "c5 = assumption(c4)",
        "out <- c5"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
